                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "99647eec-31c1-4d51-b9ac-49db9b68ab66",
                                "sense_id": "aa7c2613-167f-3bc3-b46b-722933fd703e",
                                "text": "Sin-hating powers, reformers of all vice,\nAbandoners of euil and cruell actes,\nCease to pursue with weapons of reuenge,\nMine haynous and intollerable fact."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe8df484-8339-4232-a07d-86ea774411c2",
                                "sense_id": "aa7c2613-167f-3bc3-b46b-722933fd703e",
                                "text": "[…] cold and constant Queene,\nAbandoner of Revells, mute contemplative,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81e2cbf6-3908-46a1-8c8b-646780cb496a",
                                "sense_id": "aa7c2613-167f-3bc3-b46b-722933fd703e",
                                "text": "[…] Kate’s been left in the emotional lurch by all sorts of objectifying men, psychic abandoners who range from her husband […] to her final lover […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
